ind":"update","title":"In-Game Feedback Update","summary":"Steam Next Fest Is Almost Here! + In-Game Feedback UpdateAs we approach the October Steam Next Fest, I want to take a moment to say a huge thank you to everyone who has jumped into the FREAK ACCIDENT demo so far. As a solo developer bringing my very first game to Steam, the response and player feedback have been absolutely invaluable. Your input has directly helped me refine the stealth, balance the AI, and polish the atmosphere.With Next Fest right around the corner, this will likely be the las","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T04:29:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673149","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4206180-1846018067933043","game_id":"steam-4206180","kind":"update","title":"DEMO PATCH: Improved Stealth, Streamlined Controls & AI Adjustments","summary":"WHAT’S NEW IN THIS PATCHMore Realistic Audio DetectionMaking noise by stepping on debris previously gave the stalker your exact coordinates. The AI logic has been updated so noise now alerts him to your general area, giving you a fair chance to reposition or hide before he arrives.Streamlined Leaning ControlsPeeking around corners is now smoother. You no longer need to hold Q first—simply press LMB or RMB when near a wall edge or cover object to lean in that direction.Improved Cover & Visibility","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T11:47:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933043","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4206180-1845383656391190","game_id":"steam-4206180","kind":"update","title":"DEMO UPDATE: Relentless Stalker, Tactical Leaning & Audio Tracking","summary":"A new patch for the FREAK ACCIDENT demo is now live! This update focuses on making enemy encounters far more intense and unpredictable, while giving you better tactical tools to track his movements, hide, and navigate the basement.WHAT’S NEW IN THIS PATCHOverhauled Stalker AI & MovementThe killer is no longer a silent ninja—he is now a fast, relentless stalker who swings his heavy axe the moment he spots you. Break line-of-sight immediately, dive behind cover, and wait for him to pass.Tactical L","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-04T12:24:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656391190","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4206180-1845383656388169","game_id":"steam-4206180","kind":"announcement","title":"DEVELOPMENT ROADMAP: Upcoming Patches, Features, and Future Content","summary":"Hello everyone!I’ve been hard at work refining the dread, tension, and stealth mechanics of FREAK ACCIDENT to deliver an atmospheric, fair-play survival horror experience. Today, I want to give you a transparent look at what I’m actively working on and what’s coming to the game over the next few weeks.Next Patch Overhauled \"Axe Killer\" AI BehaviorThe killer is becoming far more dynamic and lethal. During his methodical search loop across the basement's 6 zones, he moves with patient precision—bu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T01:16:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656388169","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4206180-1844751498231310","game_id":"steam-4206180","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Lore Inspection Items & Flashlight Fixes","summary":"Key Highlights & ChangesEnvironmental Storytelling & Inspection ItemsInspectable Lore Objects: The basement now contains interactable 3D narrative items, including local newspaper clippings, vintage family photographs, personal letters, and store receipts.Uncover the History: Rotate and examine items up close to piece together connections between the property, former inhabitants, and mysterious regional disappearances.Expanded Narrative: This initial set of items lays the groundwork for the farm","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T12:08:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498231310","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4206180-1844751498224442","game_id":"steam-4206180","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: The Flashlight Patch & Visual Adjustments","summary":"Full Patch NotesNew Feature: Flashlight & Battery MechanicsFlashlight Pickup: Added a collectible retro metal flashlight near the beginning of the demo.Control Toggle: Press \\ to equip/unequip and toggle the light on or off.Limited Resource: Power is finite—use the light sparingly to avoid running dry in pitch-black areas.Beam-Angle Detection: You must keep the light angled toward the floor. Raising the beam to illuminate walls or dark corners for too long will alert the killer.Hiding Discipline","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-25T12:56:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498224442","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4206180-1844751498218056","game_id":"steam-4206180","kind":"announcement","title":"AI & Stealth Rework","summary":"AI & Stealth ReworkIncreased AI Aggression: The stalker is now significantly more hostile and responsive to player presence.High-Stakes Hiding: Stepping into illuminated areas or making noise now triggers an immediate pursuit. Players must stick to the shadows and remain in a hiding spot during a cooldown period to reset the killer's alert state.Unpredictable Scares: Ambient jump scares now trigger while the killer is in an unalerted patrolling state.Gameplay & EscalationEndgame Pressure: Acquir","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T10:43:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498218056","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:29Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4206180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:48Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:47Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4206180":"2026-10-26T01:48:48Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4206180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:47Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:47Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5262880":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:48Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:48Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4206180","app_id":4206180,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:29Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"bf7858fa798f2430ce701c23cb48609fb6ee6f4abf14fc2f44e97a02dabeca91","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"When a late-night car crash on an isolated Tennessee backroad leaves you handcuffed in a rotting basement, survival means enduring the unthinkable. Navigate a decaying farm, evade a stalker, and plunge your hands into horrific environments to uncover a decades-old tragedy.